{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00335",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.71,
      "end_seconds": 2.7,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "Hello again. Come on in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 3.69,
      "end_seconds": 4.39,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Hi."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 5.78,
      "end_seconds": 12.46,
      "duration_seconds": 6.68,
      "text": "Hello, uh, doctor. I hope it's alright if I stay in for this."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 13.19,
      "end_seconds": 18.95,
      "duration_seconds": 5.76,
      "text": "Good, that'll be useful. Pull up a chair. What brings you in today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 20.96,
      "end_seconds": 27.59,
      "duration_seconds": 6.63,
      "text": "doctor, it's been waking up at three in the morning that's what we're worried about"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 28.47,
      "end_seconds": 31.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "right, and when did that start?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 32.12,
      "end_seconds": 34.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "it's been six months now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 36.89,
      "end_seconds": 41.01,
      "duration_seconds": 4.12,
      "text": "How would you describe it, mild, moderate, severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 41.96,
      "end_seconds": 56.9,
      "duration_seconds": 14.94,
      "text": "About a seven out of ten. As for trouble concentrating, I honestly can't say when that began. It might have been last month or the month before."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 57.69,
      "end_seconds": 61.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "on a normal day, how strong is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 62.81,
      "end_seconds": 63.78,
      "duration_seconds": 0.97,
      "text": "Mostly moderate."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "UNKNOWN",
      "start_seconds": 65.56,
      "end_seconds": 67.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "yes, exactly like that"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 78.61,
      "end_seconds": 83.47,
      "duration_seconds": 4.86,
      "text": "Did you get restless legs, heavy caffeine or chest pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 87.27,
      "end_seconds": 98.66,
      "duration_seconds": 11.39,
      "text": "No, no restless legs, no heavy caffeine, no chest pain. I was feeling irritable at one point, but that went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 100.7,
      "end_seconds": 106.97,
      "duration_seconds": 6.27,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any snoring, low mood or night sweats?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 108.56,
      "end_seconds": 113.94,
      "duration_seconds": 5.38,
      "text": "yeah, no, no snoring, low mood or night sweats"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 115.19,
      "end_seconds": 117.13,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "is your digestion otherwise okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 118.66,
      "end_seconds": 121.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "no, that side's been fine"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 122.15,
      "end_seconds": 123.96,
      "duration_seconds": 1.81,
      "text": "Any procedures or operations?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 125.05,
      "end_seconds": 130.58,
      "duration_seconds": 5.53,
      "text": "I had cataract surgery on my right eye last year."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 132.24,
      "end_seconds": 137.24,
      "duration_seconds": 5.0,
      "text": "Have you ever reacted badly to a medicine or food? Any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 138.37,
      "end_seconds": 150.35,
      "duration_seconds": 11.98,
      "text": "Hmm, there was some antibiotic, I was told I was allergic. But I couldn't tell you what it was called or what it did."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 162.3,
      "end_seconds": 164.21,
      "duration_seconds": 1.91,
      "text": "So, how about smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 165.23,
      "end_seconds": 168.53,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "I smoke about ten cigarettes a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 170.59,
      "end_seconds": 172.46,
      "duration_seconds": 1.87,
      "text": "alright, what about alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 173.31,
      "end_seconds": 177.52,
      "duration_seconds": 4.21,
      "text": "A beer or two most evenings, to be honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 178.89,
      "end_seconds": 180.73,
      "duration_seconds": 1.84,
      "text": "Alright, and your work?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 181.43,
      "end_seconds": 184.57,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "I drive a delivery van all day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 186.29,
      "end_seconds": 188.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "Who's at home with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 194.68,
      "end_seconds": 199.69,
      "duration_seconds": 5.01,
      "text": "It's just me and my wife at home now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 201.28,
      "end_seconds": 204.62,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "is there anything medical in your background?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 209.17,
      "end_seconds": 231.96,
      "duration_seconds": 22.79,
      "text": "Anxiety, for about ten years. I'd rather not end up on lots of tablets if I can avoid it. I've got high blood pressure. I wasn't sure whether to come in at all, to be honest. I've got acid reflux. Yes, high cholesterol."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 233.79,
      "end_seconds": 242.09,
      "duration_seconds": 8.3,
      "text": "okay, I can see high blood pressure in your file as well. Let's go through your medication. What are you taking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 243.34,
      "end_seconds": 253.98,
      "duration_seconds": 10.64,
      "text": "She takes escitalopram, 10 milligrams, once a day. She is on omeprazole, 20 milligrams, once a day, I give it to her."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 254.27,
      "end_seconds": 254.97,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Ah."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 255.76,
      "end_seconds": 265.12,
      "duration_seconds": 9.36,
      "text": "hmm, she is on rosuvastatin, 10 milligrams, at night for my cholesterol, I give it to her"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 265.63,
      "end_seconds": 268.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "Since when have you been taking it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 269.53,
      "end_seconds": 271.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "text": "For about three months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 273.03,
      "end_seconds": 277.49,
      "duration_seconds": 4.46,
      "text": "before this I was on atorvastatin; that's been stopped"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_5",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 279.42,
      "end_seconds": 288.87,
      "duration_seconds": 9.45,
      "text": "Doctor, I've got the readings for you. SpO2 99 percent on room air, temp 36.8 degrees. Pulse 70, blood pressure 126 over 77."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 290.0,
      "end_seconds": 302.74,
      "duration_seconds": 12.74,
      "text": "Okay, noted. Okay, so my impression from what you've said is this: I can't pin this down yet. We're looking at insomnia, probably stress-related or sleep apnoea."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 303.97,
      "end_seconds": 306.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.99,
      "text": "Is this going to go away?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 307.86,
      "end_seconds": 325.17,
      "duration_seconds": 17.31,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's insomnia, probably stress-related, and we'll watch how it goes. Same wake-up time every day, no screens in the hour before bed, and no coffee after lunch. That's everything from me. Any other questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 325.76,
      "end_seconds": 327.67,
      "duration_seconds": 1.91,
      "text": "No questions. Thank you."
    }
  ]
}